  notes: ATCC 1257 names freshly prepared, filter-sterilized 4% Na2CO3 and adds 10
    ml as a separate supplement. PERCENT preserves the unspecified percent basis without
    conversion to w/v, w/w, g/L or molarity. No carbonate-stock carrier is stated;
    basal-medium water and the explicitly different ethanol/water solutions do not
    establish it. Starting hydrate, solvent identity and grade, and stock preparation
    volume remain unknown.
